// KFS, keel's filesystem (kfs/SPEC.md): the format and every algorithm over it. The same source is
// compiled for aarch64-freestanding inside the kernel and for the host inside the tools and the tests,
// so nothing here may need an operating system, a float, or an allocator beyond `Buf`.

package {
  name    = "kfs"
  version = "0.0.1"
}
